<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>LMSZone | Learn, Track, Grow</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/css/style.css">
</head>

<body>
    <header class="site-header">
        <div class="container header-inner">
            <a class="brand" href="/">LMSZone</a>
            <nav>
                <ul class="nav-list">
                    <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#learning">Learning</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#community">Community</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
                </ul>
            </nav>
            <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/register">Login</a>
        </div>

        <div class="hero container" id="home">
            <div class="hero-copy">
                <span class="eyebrow">One platform for learning operations</span>
                <h1>Deliver learning programs, support learners, and measure outcomes with ease.</h1>
                <p class="hero-text">LMSZone empowers educators and organizations with tools for curriculum design, learner tracking, and team collaboration in a single learning management system.</p>
                <div class="hero-actions">
                    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/register">Start managing learning</a>
                    <a class="btn btn-light" href="#learning">See LMS features</a>
                </div>
                <div class="hero-meta">
                    <div><strong>20K+</strong> learners supported</div>
                    <div><strong>150+</strong> active programs</div>
                    <div><strong>100%</strong> instructor engagement</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-visual">
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <span class="card-label">LMS spotlight</span>
                    <h2>Plan, assign, and review learning paths</h2>
                    <p>Create curriculum structures, distribute resources, and keep learners progressing with clear milestones.</p>
                    <a class="card-link" href="#learning">Explore LMS tools</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section class="section section-features" id="learning">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="section-header">
                    <span class="section-label">Built for learning</span>
                    <h2>Run training programs, track learner progress, and keep instructors aligned.</h2>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-grid">
                    <article class="feature-card feature-card-alt">
                        <h3>Curriculum design</h3>
                        <p>Build modules, sequence lessons, and publish guided learning experiences quickly.</p>
                    </article>
                    <article class="feature-card feature-card-alt">
                        <h3>Progress tracking</h3>
                        <p>Monitor completion, grade activities, and support learners with actionable insight.</p>
                    </article>
                    <article class="feature-card feature-card-alt">
                        <h3>Team collaboration</h3>
                        <p>Coordinate instructors, mentors, and learners through shared resources and feedback.</p>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="section section-community" id="community">
            <div class="container community-grid">
                <div>
                    <span class="section-label">Learn together</span>
                    <h2>Create engaged learner communities with clear support and shared goals.</h2>
                    <p>Bring cohorts together, organize study groups, and keep everyone motivated with structured learning activities.</p>
                    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/register">Join our LMS</a>
                </div>
                <div class="community-card">
                    <div class="community-stat">
                        <strong>250+</strong>
                        <span>active cohorts</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="community-stat">
                        <strong>98%</strong>
                        <span>program completion</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="community-stat">
                        <strong>4.9/5</strong>
                        <span>learner satisfaction</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer" id="contact">
        <div class="container footer-inner">
            <p>© 2026 LMSZone. Empower learning with clarity.</p>
            <nav class="footer-nav">
                <a href="#home">Home</a>
                <a href="#learning">Learning</a>
                <a href="#community">Community</a>
                <a href="#about">About</a>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </footer>
</body>

</html>